# Privacy Policy for Dansk Statsborgerskab

**Effective Date: November 14, 2026**

Thank you for playing Dansk Statsborgerskab.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you use the Dansk Statsborgerskab mobile application.

Dansk Statsborgerskab is a satirical point-and-click adventure about applying for Danish citizenship, made by Axiomara Games (Peter Wraae Marino). It is intended for players aged 13 and over.

## 1. Information We Collect

Dansk Statsborgerskab does not require you to create an account, and we do not ask you for information such as your name, email address, phone number or postal address.

Dansk Statsborgerskab uses third-party advertising services, including Google AdMob. These services may automatically collect certain information from your device in order to provide advertisements, measure their performance, prevent fraud, and maintain the advertising service.

Depending on your device, settings, location, and consent choices, this information may include:

* IP address
* Device and advertising identifiers
* General device information
* App interactions, such as app launches, taps, and ad interactions
* Diagnostic and performance information
* Approximate location derived from information such as your IP address

We do not directly receive information that identifies you personally from Google AdMob.

The game's pictures, music and sounds are included with the app. Dansk Statsborgerskab does not use your device's microphone, camera, contacts or location services.

## 2. Information Stored on Your Device

Dansk Statsborgerskab saves your game so that you can continue where you left off. This includes:

* Where you are in the story: the place you are in, the items you carry, what you have done and learned, the game's clock, and the post that is on its way to your apartment
* The last few saved games that were replaced when you started a new game or reached the ending, so that a game wiped by mistake can be put back
* Your settings: the language you play in (English or Danish) and your music settings
* Whether you have bought "No ads"

This information is stored on your own device. It is not transmitted to us or to any third party, and we have no access to it. If your device backs up its apps' data (on Android, to your Google account), it may include this information in that backup, which is kept by your device's provider, not by us.

Uninstalling the app, or clearing its data in your device's settings, erases everything stored on your device.

## 3. Advertising

Dansk Statsborgerskab is supported by advertisements provided through Google AdMob.

The app shows banner advertisements on its start page, its settings and its credits. No banner is shown on the city map, in the game's locations or at the ending.

The app also offers optional rewarded video advertisements. The Hint button offers a short video; watched to the end, it gives you a hint of what to do next. Watching a video is always your choice, and nothing else in the game needs one: the whole story can be played without hints.

Dansk Statsborgerskab asks Google AdMob to show only advertisements rated suitable for teens (T) or younger audiences.

Depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices, advertisements may be personalized or non-personalized.

Google and its advertising partners may use device identifiers and other information to provide, measure, personalize, and improve advertising and to detect and prevent fraud.

For more information about how Google uses information from apps that use its services, please see Google's privacy information:

https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 4. In-App Purchases

The app is free to download. It offers these optional in-app purchases through Google Play:

* **No ads:** a one-time purchase that removes the banner advertisements and lets the Hint button give its hint at once, without a video.
* **Tips:** optional tips to the developer, in three sizes. A tip is only a thank-you: it gives nothing in the game, and the app says so before you pay.

Google Play handles every payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play for the prices and whether "No ads" has been bought on your Google account, so it can remove the advertisements, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## 5. Internet Access

Dansk Statsborgerskab can be played without an internet connection. Advertisements, rewarded videos and purchases need one. While your device is offline, no advertisements are shown and the Hint video is unavailable.

The app does not look at which network you are connected to.

## 6. Consent and Privacy Choices

Where required by applicable law, users may be presented with a consent message that allows them to make choices regarding the use of their information for advertising purposes.

Where such a choice has been presented, it can be revisited at any time using the Privacy button on the app's settings screen.

Users may also be able to control advertising personalization and advertising identifiers through their device privacy settings.

## 7. Children's Privacy

Dansk Statsborgerskab is intended for players aged 13 and over. It is not directed at children under 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

Parents or guardians who have questions regarding their child's privacy may contact us using the email address provided below.

## 8. Data Security

We do not operate our own servers, and Dansk Statsborgerskab sends nothing to us.

Information processed by third-party services such as Google AdMob and Google Play is handled according to their respective privacy and security practices.

Information sent by the app to these services is encrypted in transit.

## 9. Third-Party Services

Dansk Statsborgerskab uses third-party services that may collect or process information according to their own privacy policies:

**Google AdMob**: advertising, including rewarded video advertising, advertising measurement, analytics related to advertising, and fraud prevention. Its consent message is provided by Google's User Messaging Platform.

**Google Play Billing**: the "No ads" purchase and tips.

Google Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

Information about Google's use of data from apps using Google services:
https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 10. A Note on the Story

Dansk Statsborgerskab is satire. Its offices, officials, rules and tests are invented or exaggerated for comedy, and nothing in the game is legal advice or information about how to apply for Danish citizenship. The game is not connected with, or endorsed by, any Danish authority.

